[10629]="7006403B\n1\tDefeat Tarkka-oka and Cráthair\tWithin Sant Lhoer you have come across an Angmarim sorcerer, Cráthair, and his companion, the Jorthkyn Tarkka-oka. The latter is like nothing you have ever seen before. This must be one of Oganuin's foul experiments! You should defeat the pair.\n2\tUnlock the North Gate\tYou have defeated Tarkka-oka and Cráthair, and acquired the key to the North Gate. You should unlock the North Gate and continue on.\n3\tDefeat Oganuin\tYou stand before Bâr Heledh, the Glass House of Carn Dûm. Within its metal and glass walls the sorceress Oganuin practices her fell crafts, creating abominations and twisting living things towards unnatural ends. You should defeat Oganuin.\n",
[10630]="70064EE0\n1\tTalk to Chiver Me Timbers\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete the Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens, tiers 2 through 4 instance deeds or quests.\n",
[10631]="70064243\n1\tCollect water samples (total: 8)\tRhúnelleth has asked you to collect water samples from the Poison Garden and the Glass House. The Poison Garden and the Glass House are in Carn Dûm.\n2\tDeliver the water samples to Rhúnelleth\tYou should bring the water samples you collected to Rhúnelleth. Rhúnelleth is located at Bail Avarc, outside of Carn Dûm.\n",
[10632]="70064245\n1\tCollect flesh samples (total: 10)\tDolág has asked you to collect samples of flesh from the creatures within Carn Dûm's Poison Garden and the Glass House.\n2\tDeliver the samples of corrupted flesh to Dolág\tYou have collected the samples of flesh that Dolág requested. You should give these messy bits to her as quickly as possible. Dolág is located at Bail Avarc, outside of Carn Dûm.\n",
[10633]="70064241\n1\tPut witch's crown to the torch (total: 10)\tGalasdil has asked you to destroy any witch's crown plants that you might find within Sant Lhoer, the Poison Garden. Sant Lhoer is in Carn Dûm.\n2\tTalk to Galasdil\tYou have put to torch many witch's crown, and Galasdil will be happy to hear of your efforts. Galasdil is located at Bail Avarc, outside of Carn Dûm.\n",
[10634]="700479C7\n1\tCheck tapped trees for tree-sap (total: 8)\030Collect tree-sap (total: 8)\tSap-bearing Trees can be found near the Field of Cormallen. Harvest the sap from North Ithilien trees.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have gathered a good quantity of tree-sap and should now return to Thurindol.\n",
[10635]="70067F7C\n1\tReturn the phials of sap and logs to Tankho at Rakhatâb\030Collect logs from Jâghimsa ([see journal]/10)\030Collect phials of huorn sap ([see journal]/10)\tGo to Jâghimsa, the woods north-east of Rakhatâb, and collect sap from the huorns and fallen logs from the trees there. Then return to Tankho at Rakhatâb.\n",
[10636]="70016B85\n1\tDefeat Orc-sappers at Uruk-gashan (total: 6)\tOrc-sappers can be found at Uruk-gashan, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Haflith asked you to go to Uruk-gashan and defeat the Orc-sappers threatening to destroy Durin's Stone.\n2\tTalk to Haflith at Mekhem-bizru\tHaflith is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Uruk-gashan. Haflith will want to know that the Orc-sappers have been defeated, keeping Durin's Stone safe... for now, at least.\n",
[10637]="7005783A\n1\tCatch sapphire fireflies (total: 12)\tYou can find sapphire fireflies around Dol Ringwest, near Duillond, from gloaming till dawn. You should collect fireflies for the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. Return to Minas Tirith with the firefly-filled lanterns.\n3\tPlace sapphire firefly lanterns ([see journal]/4)\tThe Court of Voronwë is on the southern side of the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should place sapphire firefly lanterns in the Court of Voronwë.\n",
[10638]="70061F57\n1\tCollect the summoning horn and call Gorwen to your side\tYou have arrived at Sarch Vorn, the Black Grave. You should collect the summoning horn. It will allow you to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n2\tExplore Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tThe Dead have overrun Sarch Vorn. You should journey deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n3\tDefeat Fladach\tYou have encountered Fladach, a terrible creature that bars the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Fladach. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n4\tContinue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Fladach and cleared the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should continue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n5\tDefeat Luilloth\tYou have encountered Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Luilloth and free her remains of the fell spirit that now inhabits them. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n6\tDescend into the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should continue onward to the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n7\tDefeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have encountered Hithrengor, the Grey Fear in the deepest chamber of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear, and banish his spirit from the wight of Prince Amondir. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.\n",
[10639]="70061F66\n1\tExplore Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tThe Dead have overrun Sarch Vorn. You should journey deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n2\tDefeat Fladach\tYou have encountered Fladach, a terrible creature that bars the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Fladach.\n3\tContinue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Fladach and cleared the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should continue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n4\tDefeat Luilloth\tYou have encountered Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Luilloth and free her remains of the fell spirit that now inhabits them.\n5\tDescend into the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should continue onward to the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n6\tDefeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have encountered Hithrengor, the Grey Fear in the deepest chamber of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear, and banish his spirit from the wight of Prince Amondir.\n",
