[10643]="70061F67\n1\tExplore Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tThe Dead have overrun Sarch Vorn. You should journey deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n2\tDefeat Fladach\tYou have encountered Fladach, a terrible creature that bars the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Fladach.\n3\tContinue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Fladach and cleared the path deeper into Sarch Vorn. You should continue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n4\tDefeat Luilloth\tYou have encountered Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Luilloth and free her remains of the fell spirit that now inhabits them.\n5\tDescend into the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have defeated Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn. You should continue onward to the deepest chambers of Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.\n6\tDefeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear\tYou have encountered Hithrengor, the Grey Fear in the deepest chamber of Sarch Vorn. You should defeat Hithrengor, the Grey Fear, and banish his spirit from the wight of Prince Amondir.\n",
[10644]="70064F42\n1\tTalk to Drachyn\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete Discovery: Sarch Vorn, the Black Grave and the Sarch Vorn, the Black Grave, tiers 2, 3, and 5 quests.\n",
[10645]="7000B95C\n1\tDefeat Sarnemil\tSarnemil is at Torech Ullug, south of Echad Candelleth and on the eastern bank of the river by the rapids that flow out of Tâl Bruinen. You have defeated Sarlug and many Rock-worms, but Sarnemil escaped; however, you saw her flee to the south along the course of the Bruinen. You should return down the slopes to the Bruinen and search southward along the banks for her lair.\n2\tDefeat Sarnemil\tSarnemil is at Torech Ullug, south of Echad Candelleth and on the eastern bank of the river by the rapids that flow out of Tâl Bruinen. You have defeated Sarlug and many Rock-worms, but Sarnemil escaped; however, you saw her flee to the south along the course of the Bruinen. You should return down the slopes to the Bruinen and search southward along the banks for her lair.\n3\tTalk to Daervellas\tDaervellas is at Echad Candelleth, the Elf-camp in Tâl Bruinen, north of Torech Ullug. You have defeated Sarnemil and ended the threat of her offspring. You should now return to Daervellas with this news.\n",
[10646]="7005314F\n1\tTalk to Radagast in Hultvís\tRadagast can be found in Hultvís. You have discovered Sharkey's identity and made safe the Gladden Fields. You should return to Radagast in Hultvís.\n",
[10647]="70053F4B\n1\tDestroy heraldry of Sauron in Arandor (total: 12)\tHeraldry of Sauron can be found in Arandor. You should destroy any heraldry of Sauron that you find in Arandor.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed the heraldry of Sauron in Arandor.\n",
[10648]="7005403C\n1\tDestroy heraldry of Sauron in Parth Daenath (total: 12)\tHeraldry of Sauron can be found in Parth Daenath. You should destroy any heraldry of Sauron that you find in Parth Daenath.\n2\tTalk to Durin IV\tDurin IV can be found at Echad-in-Edhil. You should talk to Durin IV.\n",
[10649]="70020BAF\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens. You should bring the wolf-pelt you harvested as evidence of the threats the Grey Company might face in the Gloomglens.\n",
[10650]="7002F91A\n1\tDiscover Minas Rant\t\n2\tDefeat Orcs within Minas Rant (total: 10)\tThe tower of Minas Rant can be found at the western end of the stream that cuts across the Norcrofts. The Orcs inhabiting the ancient tower of Minas Rant have begun using it as a base from which to attack the neighbouring homes.\n3\tCompleted\tThe tower of Minas Rant can be found at the western end of the stream that cuts across the Norcrofts. The number of Orcs remaining in the area has been reduced, due to your efforts.\n",
[10651]="70008B80\n1\tTalk to Arifael\tThe giant Arifael is on Amon Nendir, south-west of Rivendell. Lord Elrond has asked you to speak with Arifael about the giants that have seemingly sworn fealty to Angmar and now protect Helegrod for their new masters.\n",
[10652]="70039ADF\n1\tFind the back entrance to the lumber-yard\tThe back entrance can be found downhill from the panicked Rohirrim woman, towards the water. The panicked Rohirrim woman recommended entering the lumber-yard through the back entrance in the hopes of sneaking in unnoticed.\n2\tFind Guthláf\tThe lumber-yard lies along the road to Fenmarch, north-east of Aldburg. The panicked Rohirrim woman told you to seek out Guthláf within the lumber-yard.\n3\tTalk to Guthláf\tGuthláf is in the lumber-yard, north-east of Aldburg. You should speak with Guthláf about how to reclaim the lumber-yard.\n4\tDefeat the Orc lieutenant\tThe orchard lies to the south, within the lumber-yard, east of Aldburg. Guthláf overheard the Orc's plan to burn the orchard. He suggested that you head to the orchard and defeat the lieutenant of the Orcs there.\n5\tTalk to Guthláf\tGuthláf awaits you north of the orchard. The Orc-lieutenant has been defeated and the orchard is safe. You should return to Guthláf and report the good news.\n",
[10653]="7004CE24\n1\tFind any sign of Sterkist\tThe Taurogrim took Sterkist further north. You should look for Sterkist.\n2\tFind Langhár\tLanghár has run further into the woods, to the north. You should find Langhár.\n3\tSpeak with Langhár and complete \"Deep in the Darkening Wood\"\tSterkist has been taken by the Taurogrim! You should save Sterkist!\n4\tTalk to Langhár\030Talk to Sterkist\tYou have escaped the Taurogrim and rescued Sterkist. You should talk to Langhár and Sterkist.\n5\tTalk to Thorlind\tYou have escaped the Taurogrim and rescued Sterkist. You should talk to Thorlind.\n",
[10654]="70030752\n1\tRescue crops from ravaged crofts (total: 6)\tRecently-harvested crops can be found scattered around the half-orc camp. You should collect the stolen crops and bring them to Garsfeld.\n2\tTalk to Gísling at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld\tGísling can be found in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld, south-west of the half-orc camp. You should bring the crops to Gísling.\n",
[10655]="700700B0\n1\tRecover Habbo's apples (total: 12)\tHabbo has asked you to venture into the shrew-tunnel and save his apples from their uncertain fate. The tunnel entrance is south-east of the Staddle village centre in Bree-land.\n2\tReturn the apples to Habbo Greenwort\tYou have collected a dozen of Habbo's apples. You should return them to him in the Staddle village centre in Bree-land.\n",
[10656]="700571C2\n1\tSave goats from Wargs in the Floodfells (total: 6)\tGoats in trouble may be found in the Floodfells. You should save any goats who are in trouble.\n2\tFind the Warg encampment of Ujâk-fulug in the Floodfells\tThe Warg encampment of Ujâk-fulug is located in the Floodfells. You should seek out Ujâk-fulug.\n3\tBurn goat corpses (total: 8)\tThe Warg encampment of Ujâk-fulug is located in the Floodfells. You should burn any goat corpses at Ujâk-fulug.\n",
})
